  "title": {
   "en": "Katsute no Ansatsusha ha Raise de Chigau Ikikata wo"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "en": "The Former Assassin Lives Differently in the Afterlife"
   },
   {
    "ja": "かつての暗殺者は来世で違う生き方をする"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Mira, once hailed as the strongest assassin, dies with deep regrets at the hands of her rival — a young knight.\nHowever, when she opens her eyes again, she finds herself reincarnated a year later as the daughter of a noble family, bearing the same name…!?\n\nDetermined to keep her past identity a secret, Mira tries to live a quiet, unnoticed life.\nBut over time, she becomes intrigued by a way of living that’s the complete opposite of her previous one — protecting others.\nWith a newfound resolve, she sets her sights on becoming a soldier.\n\nA thrilling reincarnation tale of a rule-breaking assassin girl rewriting her destiny!"
  },
